Key derived facts:
- SB_RING base 0xfd860000; PLL bases SB 0xfd860b00 / NB 0xfd860c00 / CPU 0xfd860d00 (base+0xb00+id*0x100)
- Alpine V2 = PLL REV2 (V2 register set); ref clk 100MHz (DTS refclk, strap bit19=1)
- CPU 1.7GHz (hardware.md a324; strap CPU_PLL_FREQ=0x5); DDR NB PLL 933.33MHz = DDR4-1866 (strap NB=0x4; DTS nbclk 0x37a18808)
- 4GB DDR4 (dmesg 1032192 pages); CPU 50C, fans ~940rpm (headroom)
- bootstrap reg 0xfd8a8110 (PBS regfile 0xfd8a8000 + 0x110), read-only strap reflection
- OTP regs 0xfd896000; eFuse cap-hash 0xfd89608c..ac (word 0x23)
- preboot actively reprograms PLL channels (pll_fixup_crypto_boost -> SB PLL 600MHz; al_pll_channel_div_set calls)
- no CPUACTLR/L2CTLR writes in A32 al_boot payload (boot-ROM/ATF territory)
